<title>USA: Apple Computer Inc Q2 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Apple Computer Inc Q2 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>CUPERTINO, Calif. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>March 28, 1997     Q2    March 29, 1996</p>
<p> Shr	 loss	   $5.64    loss	  $5.99</p>
<p> Net	 loss	 708,000    loss	740,000</p>
<p> Revs		   1,601,000		2,185,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 125,609		  123,659</p>
<p>					 6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	 loss	   $6.62    loss	  $6.55</p>
<p> Net	 loss	 828,000    loss	809,000</p>
<p> Revs		   3,730,000		5,333,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 125,071		  123,326</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 and 6 mos 1997 include a $375 million charge to write-off research and devlopment activity related to its acquisition of NeXT Software Inc.</p>
<p>Q2 and 6 mos 1997 include a $155 million charge to boost reserves associated with its current restructuring plan.</p>
<p>Excluding the charges, the operating loss for Q2 ended March 28, 1997 was $186 million, or $1.48 a share.</p>
<p>First Call mean estimate was a loss of $1.22/shr.</p>
<p>Q2 and 6 mos 1996 include restructuring charges of $207 million. Q2 and 6 mos 1996 include tax benefits of $435 million and $475 million, respectively.</p>
</text>
